{"id":"a1ff3249e9f48b08","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-thm-poincare-polya.md","title":"Poincaré–Polya Enumeration","display":"thm-poincare-polya — Poincaré–Polya Enumeration","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-poincare-polya","aliases":["58-thm-poincare-polya"],"display":"thm-poincare-polya — Poincaré–Polya Enumeration","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-group]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-poincare-polya"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-poincare-polya</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-poincare-polya — Poincaré–Polya Enumeration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group\">../batch09/58-df-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite\">../batch04/58-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective\">../batch18/58-df-bijective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e668662ec71d852\" href=\"?note=2e668662ec71d852\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(G,\\cdot,e_G)\">\\((G,\\cdot,e_G)\\)</span> (finite group)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> (an action of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> on the finite set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_X\">\\(\\mathrm{id}_X\\)</span> (the identity permutation of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> (number of colors)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:G\\to\\omega\">\\(c:G\\to\\omega\\)</span> (cycle-count function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> (orbit set for the action induced by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> on colorings)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S\\)</span> (quotient-set predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PermutationCycleRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PermutationCycleRelation}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CycleCount}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CycleCount}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ColoringOrbitQuotient}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ColoringOrbitQuotient}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PermutationIterateValue}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{PermutationIterateValue}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> 在下式定义；有限迭代不再依赖未声明的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi^n\">\\(\\pi^n\\)</span> 记号。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PermutationIterateValue}_S(y,\\pi,X,n,x)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,X,X)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land x,y\\in X\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists s\\in X^{n+1}\\;\\bigl(s(0)=x\\land s(n)=y\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;s(i+1)=\\pi(s(i))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PermutationIterateValue}_S(y,\\pi,X,n,x)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,X,X)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land x,y\\in X\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists s\\in X^{n+1}\\;\\bigl(s(0)=x\\land s(n)=y\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;s(i+1)=\\pi(s(i))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}permutation\\text{-}cycle\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PermutationCycleRelation}_S(E,\\pi,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,X,X)\\land E=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times X\\mid\n\\exists m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists z\\in X\\;(\\mathrm{PermutationIterateValue}_S(z,\\pi,X,m,x)\\land\\mathrm{PermutationIterateValue}_S(z,\\pi,X,n,y))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}permutation\\text{-}cycle\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PermutationCycleRelation}_S(E,\\pi,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,X,X)\\land E=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times X\\mid\n\\exists m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists z\\in X\\;(\\mathrm{PermutationIterateValue}_S(z,\\pi,X,m,x)\\land\\mathrm{PermutationIterateValue}_S(z,\\pi,X,n,y))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}permutation\\text{-}cycle\\text{-}count}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CycleCount}_S(c,\\pi,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,X,X)\n\\land c\\in\\omega\n\\land\\exists E,Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PermutationCycleRelation}_S(E,\\pi,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,X,E)\n\\land c=|Q|\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}permutation\\text{-}cycle\\text{-}count}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CycleCount}_S(c,\\pi,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,X,X)\n\\land c\\in\\omega\n\\land\\exists E,Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PermutationCycleRelation}_S(E,\\pi,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,X,E)\n\\land c=|Q|\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coloring\\text{-}orbit\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ColoringOrbitQuotient}_S(Q;\\rho,G,X,q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nq\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,G,X^X)\n\\land\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nE=\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in(q^X)\\times(q^X)\\mid\n\\exists g\\in G\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\nb(x)=a(\\rho(g)(x))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{41mm}{}\\land\n\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,q^X,E)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coloring\\text{-}orbit\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ColoringOrbitQuotient}_S(Q;\\rho,G,X,q)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nq\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,G,X^X)\n\\land\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nE=\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in(q^X)\\times(q^X)\\mid\n\\exists g\\in G\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\nb(x)=a(\\rho(g)(x))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{41mm}{}\\land\n\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,q^X,E)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}poincare\\text{-}polya}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(G)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\n\\land q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,G,X^X)\n\\land e_G\\in G\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot g=g\\land g\\cdot e_G=g)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathrm{id}_X,X,X)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\mathrm{id}_X(x)=x)\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\rho(g),X,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,G,\\omega)\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\mathrm{CycleCount}_S(c(g),\\rho(g),X)\n\\land\\rho(e_G)=\\mathrm{id}_X\n\\land\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\bigl(\\rho(g\\cdot h)=\\rho(g)\\circ\\rho(h)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{ColoringOrbitQuotient}_S(Q;\\rho,G,X,q)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n|Q|=\\frac{1}{|G|}\\sum_{g\\in G}q^{c(g)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}poincare\\text{-}polya}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(G)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\n\\land q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,G,X^X)\n\\land e_G\\in G\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot g=g\\land g\\cdot e_G=g)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathrm{id}_X,X,X)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\mathrm{id}_X(x)=x)\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\rho(g),X,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,G,\\omega)\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\mathrm{CycleCount}_S(c(g),\\rho(g),X)\n\\land\\rho(e_G)=\\mathrm{id}_X\n\\land\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\bigl(\\rho(g\\cdot h)=\\rho(g)\\circ\\rho(h)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{ColoringOrbitQuotient}_S(Q;\\rho,G,X,q)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n|Q|=\\frac{1}{|G|}\\sum_{g\\in G}q^{c(g)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The cycle count is now the cardinality of the orbit quotient of the permutation, rather than an unconstrained numerical symbol.</li>\n<li>The identity permutation, group identity, cycle relation, and coloring-orbit quotient are all bound objects; no free quotient or accessor notation remains.</li>\n<li>The action on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q^X\">\\(q^X\\)</span> is by permuting positions; a coloring fixed by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> is constant on each of its <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_\\rho(g)\">\\(c_\\rho(g)\\)</span> cycles, giving <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q^{c_\\rho(g)}\">\\(q^{c_\\rho(g)}\\)</span> fixed colorings.</li>\n<li>Burnside's lemma then yields the displayed orbit count.</li>\n<li>Cycle index: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_G(t_1, \\ldots, t_n) = \\frac{1}{|G|} \\sum_{g \\in G} \\prod_i t_i^{c_i(g)}\">\\(Z_G(t_1, \\ldots, t_n) = \\frac{1}{|G|} \\sum_{g \\in G} \\prod_i t_i^{c_i(g)}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Pólya's multivariate form substitutes color inventories into this cycle-index polynomial.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"2e668662ec71d852","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-quotient-set.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(G,\\cdot,e_G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{id}_X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"c:G\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PermutationCycleRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CycleCount}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ColoringOrbitQuotient}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PermutationIterateValue}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PermutationIterateValue}_S(y,\\pi,X,n,x)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,X,X)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land x,y\\in X\\\\\n&\\land\\exists s\\in X^{n+1}\\;\\bigl(s(0)=x\\land s(n)=y\n\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;s(i+1)=\\pi(s(i))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}permutation\\text{-}cycle\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{PermutationCycleRelation}_S(E,\\pi,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\pi,X,X)\\land E=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in X\\times X\\mid\n\\exists m,n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists z\\in X\\;(\\mathrm{PermutationIterateValue}_S(z,\\pi,X,m,x)\\land\\mathrm{PermutationIterateValue}_S(z,\\pi,X,n,y))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}permutation\\text{-}cycle\\text{-}count}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CycleCount}_S(c,\\pi,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\pi,X,X)\n\\land c\\in\\omega\n\\land\\exists E,Q\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{PermutationCycleRelation}_S(E,\\pi,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,X,E)\n\\land c=|Q|\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coloring\\text{-}orbit\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ColoringOrbitQuotient}_S(Q;\\rho,G,X,q)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nq\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,G,X^X)\n\\land\\exists E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nE=\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in(q^X)\\times(q^X)\\mid\n\\exists g\\in G\\;\\forall x\\in X\\;\nb(x)=a(\\rho(g)(x))\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{41mm}{}\\land\n\\mathrm{QuotientSet}_S(Q,q^X,E)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}poincare\\text{-}polya}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(G)\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(X)\n\\land q\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\rho,G,X^X)\n\\land e_G\\in G\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot g=g\\land g\\cdot e_G=g)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathrm{id}_X,X,X)\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\mathrm{id}_X(x)=x)\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(\\rho(g),X,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,G,\\omega)\n\\land\\forall g\\in G\\;\\mathrm{CycleCount}_S(c(g),\\rho(g),X)\n\\land\\rho(e_G)=\\mathrm{id}_X\n\\land\\forall g,h\\in G\\;\\bigl(\\rho(g\\cdot h)=\\rho(g)\\circ\\rho(h)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{ColoringOrbitQuotient}_S(Q;\\rho,G,X,q)\n\\Bigr)\n\\to\n|Q|=\\frac{1}{|G|}\\sum_{g\\in G}q^{c(g)}.","display":true},{"tex":"q^X","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"c_\\rho(g)","display":false},{"tex":"q^{c_\\rho(g)}","display":false},{"tex":"Z_G(t_1, \\ldots, t_n) = \\frac{1}{|G|} \\sum_{g \\in G} \\prod_i t_i^{c_i(g)}","display":false}],"bytes":3963,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4359","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-thm-poincare-polya.md|58-thm-poincare-polya]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["ed71f39f59370734","d9a25b0ac94a3598","36d7463d215be751","d583890235faf0d5","2e668662ec71d852"]}